# Phase 0B: local-only restricted artefacts (Scopus-derived keyword content).
# Full corrected maps / reparsed logs with real keyword strings live here,
# never committed. Only checksums/aggregate summaries are tracked in the repo.
restricted_local/

# Phase 1B: REAL (--mode real) LLM raw outputs quote the actual Scopus-derived
# keyword pair text verbatim in the model's own "justification" field (e.g.
# "Brazil and England are distinct geographic entities..."), same Elsevier
# licensing restriction as restricted_local/ above. Synthetic dry-run outputs
# (MockClient -- fixed placeholder text, no real keyword content) remain
# tracked; only real-mode run directories (named *_real_*, this repair's
# convention) are excluded here. Manifests/aggregate metrics/hashes are
# tracked in git; raw model completions stay local only. See
# docs/provenance/phase1b_real_raw_outputs_manifest.md.
results/current_paper/rerun_stability/run_real_*/raw_outputs.jsonl
results/current_paper/second_model/*/*_real_*/raw_outputs.jsonl

# M7 strengthening phase (2026): restricted/local-only areas for the new
# strengthening/ subtree. Circular-economy keyword strings are Scopus-derived
# (Elsevier licensing, same restriction as legacy restricted_local/ above);
# raw PMC XML and raw run outputs are local working data, not for commit.
strengthening/restricted_local/
strengthening/data_raw/
strengthening/runs/raw/

# strengthening/data_pmc/ mixes article metadata and keyword text from
# licence-eligible (CC BY/CC0) AND ineligible (e.g. CC BY-NC-ND) PMC
# articles in the same files -- it is local, mixed-licence intermediate
# research material, never releaseable as-is. Only a strictly re-filtered
# derivative under strengthening/data_release/pmc_<topic>/ (CC BY/CC0 +
# confidently_author records only) may ever be committed.
strengthening/data_pmc/
